<p>Please follow the instructions in https://github.com/rh-datascience-and-edge-practice/mlops-demo-getting-     started.git to install the demo onto the cluster</p>

<p><b>Deploy the MLOps demo</b> From the command line after logging into the Openshift cluster with oc login, as the admin, run the following commands:</p>
<pre>
# git clone https://github.com/rh-datascience-and-edge-practice/openshift-cluster-bootstrap-gitops.git
# ./bootstrap.sh
# git clone https://github.com/rh-datascience-and-edge-practice/mlops-demo-tenant-gitops.git
# ./bootstrap.sh
# git clone https://github.com/rh-datascience-and-edge-practice/mlops-demo-application-gitops.git
# ./bootstrap.sh
</pre>

<p>Before running the script to start setting up the cluster, you will need a Sealed Secret to unlock existing   sealed secrets needed for this demo. This file cannot be checked into git. If you do not have this file, you     will need to obtain it from a member of the Red Hat Data Science and Edge Practice</p>

